es%20the%20requested%20rolling%20period%20for%20each%20assessment%20date.%20As%20the%20assessment%20date%20moves%20forward%2C%20the%20first%20available%20forward%20period%20for%20the%20same%20arbitrage%20also%20moves%20forward.%20For%20example%2C%20an%20export%20arbitrage%20observed%20on%20%602026-01-02%60%20may%20use%20a%20first%20available%20load%20window%20starting%20on%20%602026-01-12%60%2C%20while%20the%20same%20rolling%20period%20observed%20on%20%602026-01-12%60%20may%20use%20a%20first%20available%20load%20window%20starting%20on%20%602026-01-22%60.%20Use%20this%20endpoint%20when%20you%20want%20the%20first%2C%20second%2C%20or%20n-th%20available%20forward%20arbitrage%20for%20each%20assessment%20date%20without%20manually%20changing%20the%20loading%20or%20discharge%20window.%22%2C%22operationId%22%3A%22getRollingCrudeArb%22%2C%22parameters%22%3A%5B%7B%22description%22%3A%22Product%2Fgrade%20name.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Agbami%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22product%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Product%2Fgrade%20name.%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Product%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22description%22%3A%22load%20port%20name%20for%20the%20combination%20you%20want%20to%20analyze.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Agbami%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22loadPort%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22load%20port%20name%20for%20the%20combination%20you%20want%20to%20analyze.%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Loadport%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22description%22%3A%22Destination%20port%20name%20for%20the%20combination%20you%20want%20to%20analyze.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Rotterdam%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22destinationPort%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Destination%20port%20name%20for%20the%20combination%20you%20want%20to%20analyze.%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Destinationport%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22des